{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Galaxy Realm! Meet Shimmer, a happy, quirky lizard. She's part of a tribe of fellow lizards dedicated to battling Void creatures and eating lots of sushi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After accidentally destroying the sacred flower that protects the village against the Void, she is now shunned by most of her community. She sets out on a mission to restore the rare magical flower.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join Shimmer\u00a0on her quest in this silly point-and-click adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point, click,   waddle and whoop your way around a uniquely hand-painted fantasy world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with your fellow villagers and search for items to solve puzzles and fulfil your quest\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet strange creatures and make new friends </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the culture and lore of the Shimmer tribe and their allies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover some of the deep, life-changing Shimmer wisdoms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect rare items, hidden in the Realm to brighten your garden </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute, unique anthropomorphic designs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax to a beautiful, original soundtrack\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3685890?t=1756237138","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685890/43a21272fbc100f01d6ecd833685336fda866a23/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756237138","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685890/a2a55c6a359b71ddd0b28c2f97b1e9e6681f78e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756237138","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamsta